      "group_of_questions": {
        "id": 29516,
        "group_variable": "Years",
        "graph_type": "fan_graph",
        "subquestions_order": "MANUAL",
        "description": "[<u>For Donald Trump, Forbes estimated his net worth at \\$2.6 billion on January 12, 2024</u>](https://web.archive.org/web/20240112150444/https://www.forbes.com/profile/donald-trump/). [<u>The Forbes 400 estimates</u>](https://www.forbes.com/forbes-400/) of Trump\u2019s net worth (released each fall) were \\$4.3 billion in 2024 and \\$7.3 billion in 2025. There is no credible record of a U.S. president\u2019s personal wealth quadrupling during their presidency in history, but [Trump\u2019s holdings in Trump Media & Technology Group](https://www.forbes.com/sites/danalexander/article/the-definitive-networth-of-donaldtrump/) (DJT) could provide a vehicle for unprecedented wealth accumulation.",
        "resolution_criteria": "Each subquestion will resolve as **Yes** if, at any point in the corresponding two-year period, the sitting president\u2019s net worth equals or exceeds 4 times its earliest value in the year before they take office.",
        "fine_print": "* Each subquestion will use the earliest archived estimate of the president's net worth from the year before they took office. If a president served for two, non-consecutive terms, the year before they assumed office for a second time will be used.\n* The primary source to resolve each subquestion will be Forbes. Net worth is calculated using Forbes\u2019 real time net worth calculator.&nbsp;E.g, as reported by Forbes, Trump\u2019s net worth was[ <u>\\$2.6 billion</u>](https://web.archive.org/web/20240112150444/https://www.forbes.com/profile/donald-trump/) on January 12, 2024. Since Forbes does not provide historical data, the Internet Archive\u2019s[ <u>Wayback Machine</u>](https://web.archive.org/) will be used to determine if/when a president crosses or equals the corresponding threshold.\n* If data from Forbes are not available, we will instead use estimates from the Bloomberg Billionaires Index. If neither are available or lack an updated estimate for the relevant president, the subquestion will resolve according to required financial disclosures filed by candidates for and holders of federal office and other credible sources.",
